        <Synonym> pars corticomedialis (Corpus amygdaloideum)</Synonym>
        <Synonym>amygdalar corticomedial nucleus</Synonym>
        <Synonym>corticomedial nuclear group</Synonym>
        <Synonym>superficial nuclei</Synonym>
        <reference>http://neurolex.org/wiki/Category:Corticomedial_nuclear_complex</reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>These structures are referred to as nuclei but have a layered cortical like structure. These areas include the anterior amygdaloid area, posterior amygdaloid area, the periamygdaloid cortex, and the bed nucleus of the accessory olfactory tract.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:label>Corticomedial nuclear complex</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


