        <Synonym>	Infundibulum of posterior lobe of pituitary gland</Synonym>
        <Synonym> Infundibular stem of neurohypophysis</Synonym>
        <Synonym> infundibulum</Synonym>
        <Synonym>Infundibular stalk</Synonym>
