        <Synonym>external medulary lamina of lentiform nucleus</Synonym>
        <Synonym>external medullary lamina</Synonym>
        <Synonym>lateral medulary lamina of globus pallidus</Synonym>
        <Synonym>lateral medulary stria</Synonym>
        <Synonym>outer medulary lamina</Synonym>
        <reference>http://neurolex.org/wiki/Category:Lateral_medullary_lamina</reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Thin band of myelinated fibers lying on the lateral (external) surface of the globus pallidus, external segment, separating it from the putamen.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
