        <Synonym>Neocortical interneurons</Synonym>
        <reference>http://neurolex.org/wiki/Category:Neocortex_Dorsolateral_prefrontal_area_layer_3_GABAergic_cell</reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>The primary GABAergic cell that has laminar-specific subtypes in human dorsolateral prefrontal cortex as visualized by immunohistochemical staining of cells for Glutamic Acid Decarboxylase-65/67.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
