        <Synonym>Double Bouquet Cell</Synonym>
        <reference>http://neurolex.org/wiki/Category:Neocortex_bouquet_double_cell</reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Type of inhibitory cortical interneuron that provides inhibitory innervation of pyramidal neurons. Most commonly described in primates; may be absent in rodent.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:label>Neocortex bouquet double cell</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


