        <Synonym>sulcus of Wernicke</Synonym>
        <reference>www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2937159/</reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>The fronto-marginal sulcus (sulcus of Wernicke) runs parallel to the junction between the lateral and ventral aspects of the frontal lobe. </rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:label>Fronto-marginal sulcus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/2009/9/Ontology1255357986125.owl#intermediate_part_of_hypophysis -->

